Tomcat started on port 8080

Then open:

http://localhost:8080

Your browser should display the Todo application.

7. Verify the API

You can also test:

GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos

Initially:

[]

Then:

POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos

with:

{
  "title": "Learn Java",
  "description": "Practice Java problem solving",
  "completed": false
}

Response:

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Learn Java",
  "description": "Practice Java problem solving",
  "completed": false
}

Then:

GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos

returns:

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Learn Java",
    "description": "Practice Java problem solving",
    "completed": false
  }
]